# Actility Magento 2 Project Rules

## Coding Standards
1. Follow PSR-2 and Magento 2 coding standards
2. Use strict_types declaration in PHP files
3. Use type hints for parameters and return types
4. Follow SOLID principles
5. Document classes and methods using PHPDoc

## File Organization
1. Follow Magento 2 module structure:
   - Block/
   - Controller/
   - etc/
   - Model/
   - view/
2. Keep files focused and single-responsibility

## Development Workflow
1. Document changes in Memory Bank
2. Update relevant documentation files
3. Follow Git commit message conventions
4. Write/update unit tests for new features
5. Maintain backward compatibility

## Quality Standards
1. Write testable code
2. Follow Magento security best practices
3. Optimize for performance
4. Consider modularity and reusability
5. Use dependency injection

## Memory Bank Management
1. Keep documentation up-to-date
2. Document architectural decisions
3. Maintain clear context in activeContext.md
4. Track progress in progress.md
5. Document technical constraints in techContext.md

Note: These rules should be followed for all development work in this project.
